              "path": [
                "createWithList"
              ]
            },
            "description": "## CreateNewUser\n\nCreates a new user in the Petstore system by submitting a list with a single user object.\n\n**Endpoint:** `POST https://petstore.swagger.io/v2/user/createWithList`\n\n---\n\n### Request Body\n\nThe request body must be a JSON array containing one or more user objects. Each user object supports the following fields:\n\n| Field | Type | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `id` | integer | Unique identifier for the user |\n| `username` | string | Username for login |\n| `firstName` | string | User's first name |\n| `lastName` | string | User's last name |\n| `email` | string | User's email address |\n| `password` | string | User's password |\n| `phone` | string | User's phone number |\n| `userStatus` | integer | User status (0 = active) |\n\n**Example body:**\n\n``` json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 233,\n    \"username\": \"laura_perez\",\n    \"firstName\": \"laura\",\n    \"lastName\": \"perez\",\n    \"email\": \"lau_p@hotmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"lauperes33\",\n    \"phone\": \"1133224455\",\n    \"userStatus\": 0\n  }\n]\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### Tests\n\nThis request includes the following automated checks:\n\n- **CHK1** – Validates that the response status code is `200`.\n    \n- **CHK2** – Validates that the response time is below `800ms`.\n    \n- **CHK3** – Validates that the response body contains the expected user data.\n    \n\n---\n\n### Expected Response\n\n- **Status:** `200 OK`\n    \n- **Body:** Confirmation message from the server upon successful user creation."
          },
